<title>CANADA: ATS Automation wins C$15 mln award.</title>
<headline>ATS Automation wins C$15 mln award.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>ATS Automation Tooling Systems Inc said its precision components operations won a C$15 million deal over five years to produce anti-lock braking system components for a multinational automotive parts producer.</p>
<p>ATS said it will begin production of new anti-lock brake parts in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Paul Casciato (416) 941-8100, or e-mail: paul.casciato@reuters.com</p>
